<title>USA: Oglebay Norton Co Q1 shr decreases.</title>
<headline>Oglebay Norton Co Q1 shr decreases.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(000's except per share amounts)		  1997	1996</p>
<p> Net sales and operating revenues		$20,409  $18,683</p>
<p> Income (loss) from operations		     1,110    (450)</p>
<p>Income from continuing operations</p>
<p>	 before income taxes			   1,205	998</p>
<p> Income from continuing operations		   853	913</p>
<p> Income from discontinued operations		  --    1,065</p>
<p> Net income						  853    1,978</p>
<p>Income per share of common stock:</p>
<p>     Continuing operations			     .35	.37</p>
<p>     Discontinued operations			    --	.43</p>
<p>     Income per share				    .35	.80</p>
<p> Average number of shares			    2,409    2,458</p>
<p>NOTE - Q1 1996 included income from discontinued iron ore operations of $1.07 million, or $0.43 per share, and was favorably affected by receipt of a state income tax refund.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
